      <p>Lodgedwell (we, us, our) is committed to protecting the privacy and security of the personal information we collect, hold and handle in the course of providing conveyancing and related services. This Privacy Policy explains what information we collect, why we collect it, how we use and disclose it, how we keep it secure, and how you can access or correct it or make a complaint.</p>
      <p>Lodgedwell is a registered business name owned by Ferny Creek Pty Ltd (ACN 698 317 565) and used under licence by Willis Property Group Pty Ltd (ABN 36 659 238 721), a licensed conveyancing practice in Victoria. The conveyancing services offered under the Lodgedwell name are provided by Willis Property Group Pty Ltd. When you engage Lodgedwell, your contract is with that company, and it is that company that collects and holds the personal information described in this Policy and is accountable to you for it. The same company also operates under the business name Willis Conveyancing.</p>
      <p>Ferny Creek Pty Ltd owns the Lodgedwell brand and supplies the technology platform through which our services are delivered. It does not provide conveyancing services, and it does not use your personal information for its own purposes. Section 7 explains the part it plays in handling your information.</p>
      <p>We handle personal information in accordance with the Privacy Act 1988 (Cth) and the Australian Privacy Principles (APPs). From 1 July 2026, as a provider of &ldquo;designated services&rdquo; in connection with the sale, purchase and transfer of real property, we are also a reporting entity under the Anti-Money Laundering and Counter-Terrorism Financing Act 2006 (Cth) (the AML/CTF Act), as amended by the AML/CTF Amendment Act 2024. Some of the information we collect, and some of the disclosures we make, are required or authorised by that regime. This Policy explains how those obligations affect your personal information.</p>

      <h2>1. About Lodgedwell</h2>
      <p>Lodgedwell is the digital conveyancing service of Willis Property Group Pty Ltd. We act for clients across Victoria in residential purchases and sales, off-the-plan and commercial transactions, transfers, and rural and regional matters.</p>
      <p>Our service is delivered primarily online. You will usually engage us, provide your instructions, verify your identity and sign your documents through our website and our online tools rather than in person, and your settlement will ordinarily occur electronically. This means that most of the personal information we hold about you is collected, transmitted and stored digitally. Sections 3, 7 and 13 explain what that means for your information. We are supported by offices in Ferny Creek, Melbourne CBD and Bendigo.</p>

